# Agent context budget

Tier 1 active preferences live in `docs/agent-context/preferences-active.md` (~80 lines). Read that file's discipline when making cross-cutting decisions.

**Do not** load `docs/agent-context/archives/*.md` unless the task touches that domain. Use [docs/agent-context/INDEX.md](docs/agent-context/INDEX.md) to pick the right archive.

| Domain | Archive |
|--------|---------|
| Waitlist / Privy / auth | `archives/waitlist-auth.md` |
| Swap / paymaster / txRouter | `archives/swap-execution.md` |
| Deploy cutover / bytecode | `archives/deploy-cutovers.md` |
| AlfaClub / Hermit | `archives/alfaclub-ops.md` |
| Protocol vs operator CSW | `archives/wallet-identity.md` |
| Relay / owner-install | `archives/wallet-relay-owner-install.md` |
| Infra / Supabase / Vercel | `archives/infra-ops.md` |

Copy-paste task templates: `docs/agent-context/prompt-templates.md`.

Continual-learning: append to Tier 1 or domain archives per INDEX.md — never bloat AGENTS.md.
